---
import ContentLayout from "../../layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Watch Multiple Kick Streams at Once | Stream Mix"
  description="Watch multiple Kick channels and chats in one draggable, resizable browser grid with Stream Mix."
  heading="Watch multiple Kick streams at once"
>
  <p>
    Stream Mix can display multiple Kick channels in one customizable workspace.
    Arrange live video and chat windows for creators covering the same game,
    event, or conversation without managing separate browser windows.
  </p>
  <h2>Add a Kick channel</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the creator’s Kick channel page.</li>
    <li>Copy the channel name from the end of the URL.</li>
    <li>Choose Kick in Stream Mix and enter the channel name.</li>
    <li>Select stream and chat, stream only, or chat only.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Official embedded content</h2>
  <p>
    Kick video and chat are loaded from Kick’s own embedded pages. Availability
    can depend on the channel’s status, Kick service availability, and browser
    privacy or content-blocking settings.
  </p>
  <p>
    Stream Mix also supports
    <a href="/guides/watch-multiple-streams"
      >layouts combining Kick, Twitch, and YouTube</a
    >.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Open the Kick multistream viewer</a>
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
